\subsection{Extending to Other Types of Summarization}
\label{sec:other-summ}

We extend the concept of using adversarial learning for multi-task summarization to two new tasks. We do this by augmenting the baseline models with a new task or a new type of summary, and then fine-tuning them on the new task as a way to extend the model.
